  {
   "key": "func OpenAICompatibleStreamer.consumeSSE(_:providerID:continuation:)",
   "hash": "fea76415c62722b7",
   "does": "Reads a reply's SSE line sequence (the URL session's lines, or a test's): only data: payloads are read. [DONE] ends the reply through finishReply (flush open tool calls, .done) and returns; every other payload goes to handleChunk, which records a finish_reason and throws on a malformed event, an error object, a filtered or overloaded stop, or cut tool arguments. A stream that closes after a finish_reason but without [DONE] also ends through finishReply; one that closes with neither was cut and throws URLError(.networkConnectionLost) (ProviderStream maps it to a fallbackable .network), so open tool-call fragments never run and the partial text never reads as complete.",
   "entry": null,
   "calls": [
    "Emuqu/Sources/Assistant/Providers/OpenAICompatibleStreamer.swift::func OpenAICompatibleStreamer.finishReply(_:continuation:)",
    "Emuqu/Sources/Assistant/Providers/OpenAICompatibleStreamer.swift::func OpenAICompatibleStreamer.handleChunk(_:providerID:state:continuation:)",
    "ext:Task.checkCancellation"
   ],
   "reads": [],
   "writes": [],
   "branches": [
    {
     "at": "+6",
     "cond": "for each line",
     "effect": "loop; sequence errors propagate."
    },
    {
     "at": "+8",
     "cond": "line is not data: (comment, blank, event:)",
     "effect": "skipped"
    },
    {
     "at": "+10",
     "cond": "payload empty",
     "effect": "skipped"
    },
    {
     "at": "+11",
     "cond": "payload == \"[DONE]\"",
     "effect": "finishReply, return."
    },
    {
     "at": "+17",
     "cond": "stream closed with no finish_reason and no [DONE]",
     "effect": "throws URLError(.networkConnectionLost); otherwise finishReply."
    }
   ],
   "deps": {
    "Emuqu/Sources/Assistant/Providers/GeminiProvider.swift::func GeminiProvider.finishReason(in:)": "698cfc1a6535a837",
